# ============================================================================
#  systemd 服务单元 —— 传感器接收/存储/查询服务
#  安装位置: /etc/systemd/system/sensor-ingest.service
#  启用步骤:
#     sudo cp sensor-ingest.service /etc/systemd/system/
#     sudo systemctl daemon-reload
#     sudo systemctl enable --now sensor-ingest
#     sudo systemctl status sensor-ingest
# ============================================================================
[Unit]
Description=Sensor Ingest & Query Service (ESP32-S3-EYE IMU)
Documentation=file:/opt/sensor-ingest/README.md
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=sensor
Group=sensor
WorkingDirectory=/opt/sensor-ingest/backend

# ---- 运行参数（按需修改） ----
Environment=SENSOR_HOST=127.0.0.1
Environment=SENSOR_PORT=8000
Environment=SENSOR_DB=/var/lib/sensor-ingest/sensor.db
Environment=SENSOR_WEB_DIR=/opt/sensor-ingest/web
# ★ 务必与固件 app_config.h 的 APP_DEVICE_TOKEN 一致，否则上传会被 401 全部拒收
Environment=SENSOR_TOKEN=esp32s3eye-demo-token-2026

ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /opt/sensor-ingest/backend/server.py

Restart=always
RestartSec=3

# ---- 安全加固：只允许写数据目录 ----
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/sensor-ingest

StandardOutput=journal
StandardError=journal
SyslogIdentifier=sensor-ingest

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target